    "updated_at": "2016-10-20T20:23:44Z",
    "body": "Tests at https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/4044 for radio button groups. I can't figure out how to test image maps. It might be possible with something really complicated (synethetic click events at some section of the page that is covered by an image map??) but given that there are no such existing tests for me to model on, I'm going to ask that we skip requiring tests for that.\n",
